    "created_at": "2016-08-23T13:58:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-23T13:58:43Z",
    "body": "Given the discussion in https://github.com/yutakahirano/fetch-with-streams/issues/66 I'm closing this. There's no real benefit in `Expect` if it is only for 100 and that status does not give us the guarantees we are looking for.\n\nNote that #366 clarified that most 1xx (apart from 101) are to be ignored by the client.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
