    "created_at": "2023-05-14T06:23:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-14T06:23:44Z",
    "body": "Inspired by Server-sent Events, I'm trying to implement Client-sent Events based on [fetch upload streaming](https://web.dev/fetch-upload-streaming/), while Fetch API supports neither  `Expect: 100-continue` request header nor `100 Continue` response status.\r\n\r\nSo I quit for now, either be patient or forget it.\r\n",
